 "title": "Fubini interchange for two categorical colimits",
 "statement": "For categories $J,K,\\mathcal C$ for which the relevant colimits exist and a diagram $H:J\\times K\\to\\mathcal C$, the iterated colimits $\\varinjlim_{j\\in J}\\varinjlim_{k\\in K}H(j,k)$ and $\\varinjlim_{k\\in K}\\varinjlim_{j\\in J}H(j,k)$ are canonically isomorphic.",
